{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13140","headline":"河南郑少尹城南亭送郑判官还河东 · 皇甫冉","name":"河南郑少尹城南亭送郑判官还河东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使臣怀饯席，亚尹有前溪。\n客是仙舟里，途从御苑西。\n泉声喧暗竹，草色引长堤。\n故绦青山在，新田绿树齐。\n天秋闻别鹄，关晓待鸣鸡。\n应叹沈冥者，年年津路迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}